                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "TOCHeading": "Exact Mass",
                "Description": "The exact mass of an isotopic species is obtained by summing the masses of the individual isotopes of the molecule.",
                "Information": [
                  {
                    "ReferenceNumber": 39,
