                "Value": {
                  "StringWithMarkup": [
                    {
                      "String": "Used to increase resistance to lodging ... and to increase yields in wheat, rye, oats, and triticale; to promote lateral branching and flowering in azaleas, fuchsias, begonias, poinsettias, geraniums, pelargoniums, and other ornamental plants; to promote flower formation and improve fruit setting in pears, almonds, vines, olives, and tomatoes; to prevent premature fruit drop in pears, apricots, and plums. Also used on cotton, vegetables, tobacco, sugar cane, mangoes, and other crops."
