                "Value": {
                  "StringWithMarkup": [
                    {
                      "String": "Chlormequat chloride is currently registered for use on a wide variety of ornamentals grown in greenhouses, shadehouses, and nurseries. Crops include herbaceous and woody annual and perennial plants such as begonias, vincas, azaleas, and poinsettias. Outdoor use is restricted to containerized ornamentals. Chlormequat chloride has no residential or food uses; therefore, there are no associated tolerances.",
