                    "Value": {
                      "StringWithMarkup": [
                        {
                          "String": "A mild eye irritant; Can be absorbed through skin; The substance may cause effects on the nervous system: cholinergic symptoms without acetylcholinesterase inhibition. [ICSC] An irritant; Can be absorbed through skin; Effects in high-dose animal studies include convulsions; [MSDSonline] Toxic to hamster embryos; No human data; [REPROTOX]"
                        }
