                        {
                          "String": "Pesticide Disposal: Wastes resulting from the /agricultural/ use of this product may be disposed of on site or at an approved waste disposal facility. Container Disposal: Triple rinse (or equivalent). Then offer for recycling or reconditioning or puncture and dispose of in /accordance with local, state, and Federal laws/."
