                    "Value": {
                      "StringWithMarkup": [
                        {
                          "String": "/ENDOCRINE MODULATION/ Twenty-four pesticides /including chlormequat chloride/ were tested for interactions with the estrogen receptor (ER) and the androgen receptor (AR) in transactivation assays. Estrogen-like effects on MCF-7 cell proliferation and effects on CYP19 aromatase activity in human placental microsomes were also investigated. .../Chlormequat chloride was inactive in all assays reported./",
